Disease Detection Urine - License and Usage Notice
======================================================

Copyright (c) Alexandre Matov. All rights reserved except as granted below.

1. Scope
--------
This repository contains R and MATLAB source code developed by
Alexandre Matov for companion diagnostics (UriWatch - LiquidThermometer)
based on urinary microRNA biomarkers. The code depends on third-party R
packages that are NOT included in this repository -- see
DEPENDENCIES.md.

